=== M-9 acceptance summary (Qwen3.5-0.8B sanity, 2026-05-07) ===
endpoints driven on this run: /healthz, /v1/models, /v1/chat/completions (non-streaming + streaming), /v1/completions, /v1/chat/completions with X-Silica-Session-ID (3-turn shared-prefix demo)
observations:
  - all openai SDK round-trips returned well-formed client objects with no validation errors
  - 3-turn shared-prefix session: usage.prompt_tokens grew 27 -> 48 -> 73, consistent with cache reuse across turns
caveats / what this run does NOT attest:
  - the route's "prefix_hit_tokens=..." INFO line is NOT present in this log: silica serve does not call silica.core.logger.setup_logging, so the silica.* logger has no handler attached at runtime, and --log-level info configures only uvicorn's loggers. The prompt_tokens growth above is supportive of cache reuse but not direct evidence of a cache hit.
  - load-bearing M-9.2 attestation is the deterministic R-f unit test tests/test_server_session_routing.py::test_three_turn_shared_prefix_demo_logs_prefix_hits_after_turn_one (pins prefix_hit_tokens > 0 on turns 2 + 3 through a near-real engine); see plans/P8_OPENING.md §6.3 / §9.3
